---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Me">
  <section class="px-[15%] py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <p class="max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-gray-700">
          I am Hikmet Cakir, a Senior Software Engineer focused on Java and Spring Boot.
          I build scalable backend architectures and distributed systems that are reliable, maintainable, and easy to evolve.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-gray-700">
          Over the years, I have worked on event-driven services, high-traffic APIs, and production-critical systems
          where performance, observability, and clean service boundaries are essential.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-gray-700">
          My approach is to turn complex technical requirements into simple, sustainable solutions,
          while prioritizing long-term code quality, clear communication, and practical engineering decisions.
        </p>
  
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-5">
          <a href="https://github.com/hikmet-cakir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub profile" class="text-gray-700 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-black">
            <i class="bi bi-github text-2xl"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/users/19926019/hikmet-cakir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Stack Overflow profile" class="text-gray-700 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#f48024]">
            <i class="bi bi-stack-overflow text-2xl"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hikmetcakir/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn profile" class="text-gray-700 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#0A66C2]">
            <i class="bi bi-linkedin text-2xl"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
